    "commit": "d93ff2d4021421fbe9b19e5aad9aa5ec829d16cc",
    "commit_body": "- Replace band-based VIX scoring with tanh gradient (pivot=22, inverted: high VIX = amplify)\n- Add dynamic VIX weight via sigmoid: ~5% at VIX 13, ~50% at VIX 22, ~95% at VIX 35\n- Invert breadth component (100-breadth) so weak breadth = high composite = amplify\n- Drop market trend component (Pearson avg -0.003, confirmed noise)\n- Wire vix_close parameter through to compute_and_apply_regime and backfill_regime\n- Fix Unicode crash in market_breadth.py (arrow character in comment)\n- Fix MemoryError in breadth backfill: replace full row load with aggregate MAX/MIN GROUP BY\n\nOOS simulation: avg Pearson +0.067 vs legacy -0.037 (5y window)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
